<title>USA: Delaware ranks fifth in U.S. for personal income.</title>
<headline>Delaware ranks fifth in U.S. for personal income.</headline>
<dateline>DOVER, Del. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delaware has the nation's fifth-highest personal income, according to new statistics released by the Delaware Economic Council.</p>
<p>The council said the average Delaware resident made $27,622 in 1996, up more than five percent from 1995.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
